{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026iRtIZmzh5g1792721795.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價升至逾三年半高位。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價報6.718，較上個交易日上調15點子，是自2023年2月2日以來的高位。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價早段都於6.67水平上落。</p><p></p><p>另外，人民銀行開展2,580億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作。扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨投放250億元人民幣。全周計算，淨投放620億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:05:17.861794+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T02:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:27:48.699955+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T02:58:06.508259+00:00","content_hash":"1e2ad0c273cf3fb0b813cde4d2d1787ea78eb90320fffd59af7e514d933bf107","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:05:17.861794+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}